blossoms#:~:text=Today%20the%20Kin%2DTree%20will,responsibilities%20of%20an%20adult.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Mar 2025."}},{"id":"tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms-e1","era":null,"summary":"Mehtma, resentful of teaching during the siege, watches Cemil on duty in the chamber and recalls wanting to serve Khan Felothar.","participants":["mehtma","cemil","khan-felothar"],"location":"qatros-karst","importance":"minor","page":"stories/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","order":944,"story_date":"2025-03-03","storyline":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","source":"wizards","paragraph":12,"quote":"Mehtma was ready to make a name for herself, to see Abzan in all its glory, to serve Khan Felothar.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=Mehtma%20was%20ready%20to,to%20serve%20Khan%20Felothar.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2025-03-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=Mehtma%20was%20ready%20to,to%20serve%20Khan%20Felothar.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Mar 2025."}},{"id":"tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms-e2","era":null,"summary":"Vauti brings Mehtma's rationed coffee but no cream, because the militia has blockaded the stables.","participants":["mehtma","vauti"],"location":"qatros-karst","importance":"minor","page":"stories/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","order":944,"story_date":"2025-03-03","storyline":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","source":"wizar